    "enumerator:rack::dsp::BooleanTrigger::State::HIGH": {
      "finding": "P1: the only cited test, tests/dsp/in_rack_basic/test_digital.py::test_boolean_trigger (lines 151-175), never references BooleanTrigger.State.HIGH and never reads s while it is HIGH; a grep of tests/ finds no use of State.HIGH for BooleanTrigger, so a wrong mapping of this enumerator would not fail the cited test (the binding at native/bindings/dsp/digital.cpp is correct). Smallest fix: add `assert t.s is dsp.BooleanTrigger.State.HIGH` after a true input in test_boolean_trigger, and/or cite test_every_reference_stream_matches_rack, which compares t.s.value with Rack after every step.",
      "verdict": "finding"
    },
