      "finding": "P1: the buffer form limits len to uint32_t (native/bindings/dsp/basic.cpp:155, values::toInt<uint32_t>(len, ..., \"size_t (at most 2**32 - 1 here)\")) although Rack's convert(const From*, To*, size_t) takes size_t and has no such bound; this restriction is neither justified by Rack UB nor stated in docs/reference/dsp.md#dsp-convert or the manifest notes. Smallest fix: convert len with toInt<size_t> (the buffer-size check already bounds it), or document the 2**32 - 1 bound in the dsp-convert section and the record notes.",
